2026-05-09T18:07:01.462Z - Updating ticket a3b4f1ad-b3de-4564-958a-57589f88f90e. Payload: {"description":"<ul><li>Improve user engagement by providing more descriptive and actionable notification content within the VDrive app.</li><li>Incorporate dynamic data points such as vehicle details, trip status updates, and specific call-to-actions.</li><li>Standardize the tone and voice across all automated communication channels to ensure a premium user experience.</li><li><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>Notification templates for booking, arrival, and payment are fully updated with dynamic fields.</li><li>Dynamic variables correctly render real-time data without displaying raw placeholders.</li><li>Deep-linking functionality is verified for all new notification types to ensure users land on the correct screen.</li><li>All new content is localized and verified across all supported regions.</li></ul></li></ul>"}
